{
  "source": "Prompts/trust-trap-college-1.mp4",
  "duration": 169.45925,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.58,
      "text": "Think about the pressure of making a major life decision,"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.96,
      "end": 5.7,
      "text": "specifically picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.46,
      "end": 9.9,
      "text": "It's one of those choices that feels like it dictates the rest of your life."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.62,
      "end": 13.42,
      "text": "Traditionally, you'd hash this out in the physical world."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.88,
      "end": 17.7,
      "text": "You sit down at the dinner table, looking for guidance from the people who raised you."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.44,
      "end": 20.48,
      "text": "Today, you have an immediate alternative."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.26,
      "end": 25.98,
      "text": "You open up a chat window, type a prompt, and get an instant response from an AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.64,
      "end": 30.96,
      "text": "To see the difference between these two types of guidance, we need to run a simple test."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.62,
      "end": 35.02,
      "text": "We ask the exact same pivotal question in both environments."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.76,
      "end": 36.6,
      "text": "The question is straightforward."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.42,
      "end": 38.94,
      "text": "Should I choose Michigan or Indiana?"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.94,
      "end": 44.26,
      "text": "By looking at the responses side by side, we can evaluate what makes advice reliable"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.26,
      "end": 48.22,
      "text": "and figure out who or what actually deserves our trust."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.08,
      "end": 53.22,
      "text": "Looking at this comparison graphic, let's start with the human baseline on the left."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.22,
      "end": 54.42,
      "text": "You asked your mom."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.98,
      "end": 55.76,
      "text": "Her answer is immediate."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.4,
      "end": 56.6,
      "text": "Indiana."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.56,
      "end": 60.94,
      "text": "She explains her reasoning by pointing out that you seemed more comfortable there."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.52,
      "end": 65.04,
      "text": "And crucially, she notes that when you get stuck, you tend to go quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.68,
      "end": 68.14,
      "text": "Meaning you need a place where you'll actually ask for help."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.28,
      "end": 71.48,
      "text": "The truth behind this advice is that she knows you."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.96,
      "end": 75.32,
      "text": "She has a rich history of observing your behavior in difficult situations."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.2,
      "end": 79.2,
      "text": "More importantly, she has a stake in what happens to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.2,
      "end": 82.64,
      "text": "If you struggle or drop out, she feels the consequences."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.64,
      "end": 88.66,
      "text": "Her guidance ignores national rankings and instead prioritizes your long-term well-being"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.66,
      "end": 91.08,
      "text": "and personal compatibility with the environment."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.02,
      "end": 97.62,
      "text": "Now, shift over to the right side of the matrix, to the artificial source, the chatbot."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.24,
      "end": 99.7,
      "text": "The AI recommends Michigan."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.7,
      "end": 105.82,
      "text": "Its reasoning relies entirely on generic marketing points, citing world-class academics"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.82,
      "end": 107.82,
      "text": "and a vibrant campus community."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.82,
      "end": 110.72,
      "text": "The mechanics here are vastly different."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.44,
      "end": 114.06,
      "text": "The chatbot only knows what you typed into the prompt box."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.66,
      "end": 116.14,
      "text": "It has zero historical context."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.78,
      "end": 120.66,
      "text": "It has never seen how you act when you're stuck, overwhelmed or struggling."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.52,
      "end": 124.94,
      "text": "And it bears absolutely no consequences for its recommendation."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.9,
      "end": 127.8,
      "text": "It has no stake in which school you choose."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.34,
      "end": 132.04,
      "text": "It is simply processing text without any real-world context,"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.04,
      "end": 137.78,
      "text": "generating a persuasive string of words that mimics empathy without actually feeling it."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.58,
      "end": 142.04,
      "text": "When you step back and look at the whole board, the true divide is clear."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.86,
      "end": 148.68,
      "text": "You are weighing a lifetime of personal history against a few seconds of algorithmic text processing."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.5,
      "end": 153.24,
      "text": "So, looking at both of these answers, which one would you trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.46,
      "end": 157.84,
      "text": "Accessing a massive database of information produces a quick answer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.84,
      "end": 162.94,
      "text": "but true reliability requires understanding deeply personal context,"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.48,
      "end": 165.9,
      "text": "and having a very real stake in the outcome."
    }
  ],
